6011	{"artifactId":"LLD-bd1c6c9005ff6390-s1","entry":{"id":"migrated-LLD-bd1c6c9005ff6390-s1-review","actor":{"id":"insrc:daemon","kind":"agent","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-17T09:02:37.523Z","operation":"review","outcome":{"result":"warn","summary":"review: warn","data":{"kind":"review","report":{"artifact":"design.story","stage":"design.story","verdict":"warn","findings":[{"claimId":"fix-targets-defect.1","ref":"fix-targets-defect","item":"fix-targets-defect","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Scanning module-level test callbacks with the file entity as caller addresses the missing testsReaching root cause.","evidence":"walkNode currently descends through expression statements without extracting calls. walkForCalls recursively visits callback bodies. Grounding uses `callers.filter(c => isTestFile(c.file))`, without restricting caller entity kind. The proposed file-source CALLS therefore addresses the stated defect. [files: src/indexer/parser/typescript.ts, src/workflow/code-review/grounding.ts, src/indexer/cross-file-resolver.ts]","action":"Implement the proposed extraction and parser-to-grounding integration test.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"fix-targets-defect.2","ref":"fix-targets-defect","item":"fix-targets-defect","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The narrowed scope leaves out none of the approved ISSUE fix intent.","evidence":"The repository ISSUE still says: 'The same is checked, and fixed where it applies, for the other language parsers.' The supplied design cites stakeholder feedback de8a2c97 narrowing that scope, but the inspected repository artifacts do not contain that feedback or a corresponding scope transfer. Analyzer access also failed with invalid_json_schema. [files: docs/standalone/record-calls-made-module-level-statements-E20261017bd1c6c90/ISSUE.md, docs/standalone/record-calls-made-module-level-statements-E20261017bd1c6c90/S001/LLD.md]","action":"Attach the narrowing decision or update the ISSUE and identify the destination Story for deferred parser work.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"could-not-verify"},{"claimId":"current-behaviour.1","ref":"current-behaviour","item":"current-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Current extraction omits the listed module-level contexts, field initializers and constructors; test recognition has exactly the two described branches.","evidence":"extractCalls is invoked from function, method and function-valued declarator bodies. extractClass visits methods only; extractMethod returns for `constructor`; export handling visits only `declaration`. isTestFile is `/(^|\\/)__tests__\\//.test(file) || /\\.(test|spec)\\.[cm]?[jt]sx?$/.test(file)`, so its directory branch is language-independent. [files: src/indexer/parser/typescript.ts, src/workflow/code-review/grounding.ts]","action":"Retain these precise descriptions of existing behavior.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"change-sites.1","ref":"change-sites","item":"change-sites","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The specified parser functions and isTestFile are sufficient change sites for the enumerated extraction contexts and direct imported-function grounding path.","evidence":"parse supplies fileId to walkNode; extractClass creates a class ID before visiting members; extractArrowFunction controls function-valued declarators. resolveRelations preserves relation sources, and resolveCall derives visibility from the source entity's file and language without requiring a function source. realGroundingDeps reads CALLS neighbors without filtering caller kinds. [files: src/indexer/parser/typescript.ts, src/indexer/resolver.ts, src/indexer/cross-file-resolver.ts, src/workflow/code-review/grounding.ts]","action":"Keep export-context handling explicit and perform class extraction within the existing class HTTP-field scope.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"preserved-behaviour.1","ref":"preserved-behaviour","item":"preserved-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"File/class-source edges and pending relations use existing deletion cleanup without a new entity-kind-specific path.","evidence":"fileEvent's delete branch and indexFile's cleanFirst branch invoke entity and unresolved-row deletion. deleteEntitiesForFile collects all file entities and calls detachDeleteEntities; its transactional core calls `sweepOutgoingEdges(s, u64)` and `sweepIncomingEdges(s, u64)`. deleteUnresolvedForFile removes rows through the file index, independent of caller kind. [files: src/indexer/index.ts, src/db/entities.ts, src/db/relations.ts]","action":"Preserve the existing file/repo metadata on emitted relations.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"tests.1","ref":"tests","item":"tests","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The proposed tests provide regression assertions for each of the three derived acceptance criteria.","evidence":"For ac1, the current parser cannot emit the proposed module-level or constructor-source assertions. For ac2, the real-parser integration fixture currently produces no callback CALLS edge, so testsReaching would be empty. For ac3, current isTestFile rejects examples such as test_example.py, example_test.go and FooTest.java. Existing grounding tests use a synthetic function caller and do not already prove this integration. The two new test files are planned, not implemented or executed. [files: src/indexer/parser/typescript.ts, src/workflow/code-review/grounding.ts, src/workflow/code-review/__tests__/grounding.test.ts, src/indexer/__tests__/cross-file-resolver-lmdb.test.ts]","action":"Implement the mapped tests, using the real resolver and realGroundingDeps for ac2, and demonstrate failure before the fix.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"}],"counts":{"high":0,"med":0,"low":6,"unverified":1},"template":"design-issue","reviewedAt":"2026-10-17T09:02:37.523Z","model":"cli-codex:gpt-6-astra","reviewedBy":"daemon"},"resolutions":{}}}}}
